5.3 Business rules
• FulfilmentDays uses the original dates. A whole-year shift does not change the gap between two dates, but computing it from source dates avoids leap-year edge cases.
• Never SUM Freight or TaxAmt after joining FactOrder to FactSales. Each order's freight would repeat once per line. Aggregate one side first (rule R7 in practice).
