6.3 Business rules
• Quota dates are not guaranteed to be the first day of a calendar quarter. Load the date as given. Assigning a quota to a quarter is done later through DimDate, and that rule should be written into your measure documentation.
• Quotas are per rep and period. Never SUM them across reps and compare to total company revenue without stating that scope.
